LUPOMAX&reg; pellets are designed to provide consistent hop aroma and flavor that will vary depending on the point of addition within the brewing process. They will also contribute to beer bitterness when added to the kettle or whirlpool, where the amount of bitterness introduced will be dependent on factors such as temperature, time, wort gravity, and other brewing parameters. Due to the removal of a portion of hop vegetative matter during processing, LUPOMAX&reg; pellets will impart less green/grassy character than traditional T90 pellets or whole cone hops. This should be taken into consideration during recipe development. Brewing efficiency and yield should increase with less beer loss when using LUPOMAX&reg; enriched pellets in place of traditional hop pellets or cones.
